      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you come back after becoming stronger?",
      "translation" : "变强之后再回来吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Maybe, level 130.",
      "translation" : "至少要达到130级吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A long time ago, this castle did not look like this.",
      "translation" : "很久以前，这座城堡并不是现在这个样子。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, I'm sorry. I'm muttering in front of a stranger.",
      "translation" : "啊，抱歉。我竟然当着陌生人的面自言自语。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My name is Hugin. I'm studying the dimensional gap between time and space.",
      "translation" : "我叫休金，正在研究时空之间的次元裂缝。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's something like that here?",
      "translation" : "这里也有那样的东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you ever wondered about the history of Glast Heim?",
      "translation" : "你有没有想过古城的历史？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There was a King named Shumiche who was known as a tyrant in the history of the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom.",
      "translation" : "卢恩-米德加兹王国的历史上，曾有一位名叫舒米切的国王，被称为暴君。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Time will reveal the true answers if we look in the right places.",
      "translation" : "只要找对地方，时间终会揭示真相。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't care about history",
      "translation" : "我对历史不感兴趣"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That is interesting. Did you find anything?",
      "translation" : "这很有趣。你发现了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Really? Hmm, please come back later when you are interested then.",
      "translation" : "真的吗？嗯，那等你感兴趣的时候再回来吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Actually, dimensional time travel is possible but I'm too afraid to go there.",
      "translation" : "其实，次元时空旅行是可行的，只是我太害怕，不敢进去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It might be possible for you!",
      "translation" : "或许你能做到！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you want to time travel?",
      "translation" : "你想进行时空旅行吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, thanks.",
      "translation" : "不用了，谢谢"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, of course I do!",
      "translation" : "当然想！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Really? But, jumping gigawatts, this is such a great opportunity.",
      "translation" : "真的吗？天哪，这可是千载难逢的好机会！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I knew that you would understand what I said. Well, please tell me what you want to do.",
      "translation" : "我就知道你会理解我的话。那么，告诉我你想做什么吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Umm? Did you see me at another place? I don't think so. What about this time?",
      "translation" : "嗯？你之前在别的地方见过我吗？我想没有吧。这次又有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you make a party with more than 1 person and talk to me again?",
      "translation" : "先组建一支至少有两人的队伍，再来和我说话吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have we met before? No way. It's my first time seeing you. What do you want?",
      "translation" : "我们以前见过吗？不可能，这是我第一次见你。有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Enter Old Glast Heim",
      "translation" : "进入旧格拉斯特海姆"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel",
      "translation" : "取消"
